                          <SHORT-NAME>IcuChannelWakeupInfo</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">If the wakeup-capability is true the wakeup source referenced  is transmitted to the ECU State Manager (EcuM) .</L-2>
